# Every repo in the org that ships to the box, one per line.
#
# This is a RATCHET, not documentation. deploy-freshness-audit.mjs compares its
# survey against this list and fails --check when a baselined repo was not
# surveyed AT ALL, because a repo the running token cannot see is absent from
# `gh repo list` in exactly the same way as a repo that does not exist — and the
# audit will otherwise print "✓ every deploying repo has its main tip live"
# having never looked at it. That happened: annushka is PRIVATE, CI's token
# could not enumerate it, and a clean CI run covered 20 of 21 repos.
#
# Coverage may RISE: when a repo starts deploying, the audit prints it as an
# addition and you add the line. A FALL is a finding. If a repo is genuinely
# retired, remove its line in the same PR that retires it, so a human sees the
# decision instead of the gate quietly getting smaller.
annushka
aoz-housing
botsmann
camille-boulangerie
causius
datacat
diplodoctor
evig
heidi
hirnli
kivvi
loki
petvity
printcraft
reparaturbonus-zh
s-ink
sbb-fundbuero
solon
substrata
surf-your-life
